### The approval boundary
- `send` refuses any draft that is not `approved` or `edited`; an edit counts as approval.
- The send log is keyed by item id and draft version. A second send of the same key is refused with an error (exit code 3); it is never skipped silently.
- Every transition is logged with a timestamp and an actor.

